on.","citation_ids":["cite.long.record-257bm-c20"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257bm-c20"],"id":"long.record-257bm-c20","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.88 (Half-membership and infinitely many skips)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.88, p. 69, label record:257bm-c20","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*$$\n\\tfrac12\\in\\ensuremath{\\mathcal A} \\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\; \\text{the set of ranks skipped by the greedy rule for }\\tfrac12\\text{ is infinite}.\n$$\nOdd-denominator parity supplies the positivity clause in Theorem 6.68 automatically. Thus its cofinal-positive-skip hypothesis is exactly the assertion that the greedy skipped support is infinite, which the displayed theorem identifies with half-membership. See Observation 6.132 for the reason this restatement does not itself prove membership.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c20","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c20","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-c20%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.half_mem_mersenneAchievementSet_iff_greedySkippedSupport_infinite%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-c20%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.half_mem_mersenneAchievementSet_iff_greedySkippedSupport_infinite%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.half_mem_mersenneAchievementSet_iff_greedySkippedSupport_infinite"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c20","id":"sha256:72